    "Details": "The -O2 is an attempt to make a design more geared towards the shortcomings of the Mauler Laser, focused on short range weaponry by an UAC/20 and a Streak SRM6. Even with these changes the design still suffers from issues with inadequate cooling and long range engagements as it lacks the speed to close on its foes.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.28</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
